{
  "html": "<div class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-folio\">\n      <span>FOLIO · II — CALIGULA</span>\n      <span>SEC FOOTNOTE QUALITY ENGINE</span>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"hero-kicker\">\n        <span class=\"marker\">PNS · II</span>\n        Project Caligula &nbsp;·&nbsp; Footnote ingestion\n      </div>\n      <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Structuring what<br>the models<br><em>leave out.</em><sup>[2]</sup></h1>\n      <p class=\"hero-body\">\n        <span class=\"drop\">P</span>ublic screens miss the footnotes that drive E&amp;P quality:\n        reserve replacement, hedge floors, depletion risk, unit margins, and capital\n        discipline. Caligula extracts those disclosures, maps them into auditable ledgers,\n        and scores each company through a point-in-time 8-pillar framework.\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- Sub-navigation segment control -->\n      <div class=\"seg-wrap\" style=\"margin-bottom:18px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <button id=\"subbtn-rankings\" class=\"on\">Quality Ledger</button>\n        <button id=\"subbtn-backtest\">Performance Ledger</button>\n        <button id=\"subbtn-audit\">Audit Trail</button>\n        <button id=\"subbtn-eogdcf\">EOG DCF</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Search wrap -->\n      <div class=\"search-wrap\">\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"ticker-input\" placeholder=\"Search E&amp;P ticker symbol, e.g. EOG, FANG, DVN…\">\n        <button id=\"search-trigger-btn\">Analyze</button>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"search-error-msg\" class=\"search-err\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <aside class=\"hero-card\">\n      <div class=\"hero-card-hdr\"><span>Plate II · Engine</span><span>AUDITED PIPELINE</span></div>\n      <dl>\n        <div><dt>Inputs</dt><dd>SEC <em>footnotes</em></dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Audit</dt><dd>SHA-256 ledgers</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Pillars</dt><dd>Eight</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Universe</dt><dd>31 names</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Window</dt><dd>2014–2026</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>Controls</dt><dd>PIT cutoff</dd></div>\n      </dl>\n      <div class=\"hero-card-foot\">\n        <span class=\"status live\">Proof package generated</span>\n        <span>Phase II complete</span>\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- LOADER -->\n  <div class=\"loader-wrap\" id=\"api-loader\">\n    <div class=\"loader-text\">Ingesting SEC Filings &amp; Computing 8 Pillars…</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 1. Rankings Ledger Subview -->\n  <div id=\"caligula-rankings-subview\" class=\"view\">\n    <section style=\"padding-top:48px\" data-folio=\"P. II.01 / LEDGER\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" data-num=\"§ II.01\">E&amp;P Study Universe &nbsp;·&nbsp; 8-Pillar Quality Ledger</div>\n      <p class=\"hero-body\" style=\"max-width:760px;margin-bottom:28px\">\n        Company scores are sector-normalized across eight pillars: unit economics, capital\n        discipline, balance sheet, hedge book, reserves, operational quality, sentiment, and\n        macro sensitivity. Each score must trace back to a filing, extraction row, or declared\n        methodology input.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"results-wrap\">\n        <table id=\"universe-table\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Rank</th>\n              <th>Ticker</th>\n              <th>Tier</th>\n              <th>Composite</th>\n              <th>Unit Econ.</th>\n              <th>Cap. Disc.</th>\n              <th>Bal. Sheet</th>\n              <th>Hedge Book</th>\n              <th>Reserves</th>\n              <th>Operational</th>\n              <th>Sentiment</th>\n              <th>Macro</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"universe-tbody\">\n            <tr>\n              <td colspan=\"12\" class=\"td-sub\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:40px 0\">Loading study rankings…</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"footnote\" style=\"margin-top:18px\">\n        Point-in-time dates are enforced through filing cutoff logic. Public rankings should never display metrics that are not generated by the canonical pipeline.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 2. Performance Ledger Subview -->\n  <div id=\"caligula-backtest-subview\" class=\"view\">\n    <section style=\"padding-top:48px\" data-folio=\"P. II.02 / PERFORMANCE\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" data-num=\"§ II.02\">Performance Ledger &nbsp;·&nbsp; 2014 Q1 → 2025 Q4</div>\n      <p class=\"hero-body\" style=\"max-width:820px;margin-bottom:36px\">\n        Caligula’s backtest is now represented as a reproducible ledger rather than a standalone\n        chart. The ledger separates long basket return, short basket return, long-short return,\n        benchmark return, excess return, turnover, drawdown, risk exposures, transaction\n        assumptions, and filing delay. It does not prove the strategy — it makes the claim\n        <em>inspectable</em>.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"approach-grid\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n        <div class=\"approach-col\">\n          <h2><span class=\"num\">i. Premise</span>Historical <em>variance</em><br>and returns.</h2>\n          <p>\n            A 12-year quarterly point-in-time simulation, rebalancing every quarter. We buy\n            the top quartile of highest-ranked corporate names (Long basket) and short the\n            bottom quartile (Short basket) to surface the inspectable risk-adjusted performance record of\n            the 8-pillar scoring engine.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"approach-col\">\n          <h2><span class=\"num\">ii. Universe</span>Portfolio <em>selection.</em></h2>\n          <p>\n            The simulation runs across two studies — the focused <strong>Permian Basin E&amp;P\n            Study</strong> and a diversified <strong>General Corporate Equities</strong> index. The\n            Sharpe improvement is the experiment: does pulling qualitative detail out of footnotes\n            survive reproducibility checks?\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Segment Controller -->\n      <div class=\"seg-wrap\">\n        <button id=\"bt-toggle-ep\" class=\"on\">Permian Basin E&amp;P Study</button>\n        <button id=\"bt-toggle-gc\">General Corporate Equities</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Backtest Stat Strip -->\n      <div class=\"stat-strip\" id=\"bt-stat-strip\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)\">\n        <!-- Populated dynamically -->\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Charts grid -->\n      <div class=\"editorial-split\" style=\"margin:40px 0 48px\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Cumulative wealth path <em style=\"color:var(--gh)\">(1.0 = par)</em></h2>\n          <div class=\"chart-box\" id=\"bt-chart-container\" style=\"min-height:360px\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Quarterly return <em style=\"color:var(--gh)\">breakdown</em></h2>\n          <div class=\"chart-box\" id=\"bt-bar-chart-container\" style=\"min-height:360px\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" data-num=\"§ II.02.a\">Quarterly Detail Ledger</div>\n      <div class=\"results-wrap\" style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Quarter</th>\n              <th>Long Return</th>\n              <th>Short Return</th>\n              <th>L/S Net</th>\n              <th>N (Long)</th>\n              <th>N (Short)</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody id=\"bt-tbody\"></tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 2b. Audit Trail Subview -->\n  <div id=\"caligula-audit-subview\" class=\"view\">\n    <section style=\"padding-top:48px\" data-folio=\"P. II.04 / AUDIT\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" data-num=\"§ II.04\">Audit Trail &nbsp;·&nbsp; Phase II Proof Artifacts</div>\n      <p class=\"hero-body\" style=\"max-width:780px;margin-bottom:36px\">\n        Phase II upgraded Caligula from a working research model into a reproducible pipeline.\n        Every signal traces to one of six declared ledgers, and the published dashboard reads\n        generated JSON rather than computing anything in the browser.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"audit-grid\">\n        <div class=\"audit-card\">\n          <div class=\"audit-num\">01</div>\n          <h3>Extraction Ledger</h3>\n          <p>Tracks filing accession, filing date, accepted datetime, source table, raw extracted text, prompt version, model name, confidence score, human override flag, and audit hash.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"audit-card\">\n          <div class=\"audit-num\">02</div>\n          <h3>Reserve Ledger</h3>\n          <p>Maps proved developed, proved undeveloped, total proved, oil, gas, NGL mix, standardized measure, production, extensions, revisions, purchases, and sales.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"audit-card\">\n          <div class=\"audit-num\">03</div>\n          <h3>Universe Ledger</h3>\n          <p>Documents quarterly eligibility, filing availability, market cap, liquidity, basin classification, listing status, and delisting-return treatment.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"audit-card\">\n          <div class=\"audit-num\">04</div>\n          <h3>Performance Ledger</h3>\n          <p>Stores long, short, long-short, benchmark, excess return, CAGR, volatility, Sharpe, Sortino, drawdown, turnover, beta exposure, commodity beta, costs, slippage, filing delay, and failed extraction rate.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"audit-card\">\n          <div class=\"audit-num\">05</div>\n          <h3>PIT Audit Example</h3>\n          <p>Shows one concrete quarter where the latest filing used was available before the signal date. This is the survivorship and look-ahead bias defense.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"audit-card\">\n          <div class=\"audit-num\">06</div>\n          <h3>Static Website Export</h3>\n          <p>The dashboard reads generated JSON. It does not compute rankings, valuation, or returns inside the UI.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" data-num=\"§ II.04.a\" style=\"margin-top:56px;margin-bottom:22px\">Validation Gates &nbsp;·&nbsp; Proof Package Log</div>\n      <div class=\"gate-log\">\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">make</span><span class=\"gate-state\">passed</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">black</span><span class=\"gate-state\">passed</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">flake8</span><span class=\"gate-state\">passed</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">tests</span><span class=\"gate-state\">10 passed</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">stub scan</span><span class=\"gate-state\">passed</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">schema check</span><span class=\"gate-state\">passed</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">claim-language scan</span><span class=\"gate-state\">empty</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">static JSON</span><span class=\"gate-state\">generated</span></div>\n        <div class=\"gate-row\"><span class=\"gate-mark\">✓</span><span class=\"gate-name\">proof package</span><span class=\"gate-state\">archived</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 3. Single-Name Deep Dive Subview -->\n  <div id=\"caligula-deepdive-subview\" class=\"view\">\n    <section style=\"padding-top:48px\" data-folio=\"P. II.03 / DEEP DIVE\">\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" data-num=\"§ II.03\" id=\"dd-kicker\">Single-Name Diligence Ledger</div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:40px\">\n        <h1 id=\"dd-title\" style=\"font-size:clamp(36px,5.6vw,68px);line-height:1.02;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:500\">\n          Operator <em>EOG</em> Analysis\n        </h1>\n        <p id=\"dd-meta\" style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--ash);text-transform:uppercase\">\n          Energy &nbsp;·&nbsp; Oil &amp; Gas Exploration &amp; Production &nbsp;·&nbsp; Trailing LTM\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"stat-strip\" id=\"dd-stat-strip\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);margin-bottom:48px\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"narrative-card\" id=\"dd-narrative-card\" style=\"display:none\">\n        <div class=\"narrative-hdr\">Strategic Standing</div>\n        <div class=\"narrative-body\" id=\"dd-narrative-summary\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"editorial-split\" style=\"margin-bottom:48px\">\n        <div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Pillar coverage <em style=\"color:var(--gh)\">breakdown</em></h2>\n          <div class=\"chart-box\" id=\"dd-chart-container\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Metrics <em style=\"color:var(--gh)\">ledger</em></h2>\n          <div class=\"results-wrap\">\n            <table>\n              <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <th>Metric</th>\n                  <th>Value</th>\n                  <th>Score</th>\n                </tr>\n              </thead>\n              <tbody id=\"dd-metrics-tbody\"></tbody>\n            </table>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"sec-label\" data-num=\"§ II.03.a\" style=\"margin-top:52px;margin-bottom:24px\">Historical Quality Path</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Diligence score <em style=\"color:var(--gh)\">evolution</em></h2>\n        <div class=\"chart-box\" id=\"dd-history-chart-container\" style=\"min-height:280px\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n           PLATE II.5 / EOG DCF OVERLAY\n           (Hidden by default; displayed only when EOG is queried)\n      ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->\n      <div id=\"eog-dcf-plate\" style=\"display:none;margin-top:64px;border-top:1px solid rgba(17,16,8,.12);padding-top:48px;animation:fade .4s ease\">\n        <div class=\"sec-label\" data-num=\"§ II.03.b\" style=\"color:var(--go);margin-bottom:24px\">Folio Plate II.5 &nbsp;·&nbsp; EOG DCF Overlay</div>\n\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom:36px\">\n          <h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);font-weight:500;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.04\">\n            Folio Plate <em>II.5</em> &nbsp;·&nbsp; EOG<br>DCF <em>Overlay</em>\n          </h1>\n          <p style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--ash);text-transform:uppercase\">\n            Audit-Traceable DCF Overlay &nbsp;·&nbsp; Reserve-Bucket Terminal Value\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"hero-body\" style=\"max-width:820px;margin-bottom:32px\">\n          EOG Resources was selected as a Caligula top-quartile quality name and tested through a\n          linked DCF overlay. The model uses strip-driven revenue, hedge-adjusted near-term realized\n          pricing, WACC sensitivity, and a reserve-bucket terminal value.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- Rating banner -->\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:16px 22px;margin-bottom:40px;background:rgba(184,146,42,.06)\">\n          <span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ash)\">Rating</span>\n          <span style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.06em;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)\">Watchlist&nbsp;/&nbsp;Mildly Undervalued</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Diligence fields ledger -->\n        <div class=\"results-wrap\" style=\"margin-bottom:48px\">\n          <table>\n            <thead>\n              <tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th></tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr><td>Draft valuation date</td><td style=\"font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--ink)\">Q2 2026 (draft)</td></tr>\n              <tr><td>Market data pulled as of</td><td style=\"font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--ink)\">05 Jun 2026</td></tr>\n              <tr><td>Base WACC</td><td style=\"font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--ink)\">8.77%</td></tr>\n              <tr><td>Reserve-life value</td><td style=\"font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--ink)\">$149.60 / sh</td></tr>\n              <tr><td>Exit EBITDA sanity check</td><td style=\"font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--ink)\">$143.10 / sh &nbsp;·&nbsp; 5.5×</td></tr>\n              <tr><td>Implied long-run WTI</td><td style=\"font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--ink)\">$68.50 / bbl</td></tr>\n              <tr><td>Rating</td><td style=\"font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--go);font-weight:700\">Watchlist / Mildly Undervalued</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Method Narrative + Sensitivity -->\n        <div class=\"editorial-split\" style=\"margin-bottom:48px\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Methodology &amp; signal <em style=\"color:var(--gh)\">reconciliation</em></h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ash);margin-bottom:14px;text-wrap:pretty\">\n              Project Caligula’s systematic engine flagged EOG as a top-quartile fundamental operator in the Permian Basin. This DCF overlay reconciles that quality signal against the public market. Under our base WACC of <strong>8.77%</strong>, EOG’s reserve-life depletion terminal value implies an intrinsic share price of <strong>$149.60</strong>, representing a <strong>5.9% upside</strong> over current market pricing.\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ash);margin-bottom:14px;text-wrap:pretty\">\n              Unlike traditional models that assume infinite terminal growth, we utilize a <strong>reserve-life depletion model</strong> (hyperbolic decline exponent <em>b = 0.9</em>, initial decline <em>D<sub>i</sub> = 25%</em>) over a 25-year terminal phase to physically deplete EOG’s proved reserve base. Under this realistic constraint, we compare the spread to the traditional EBITDA multiple method (5.5×), which yields an intrinsic price of <strong>$143.10</strong>.\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.85;color:var(--ash);margin-bottom:14px;text-wrap:pretty\">\n              The current market price of <strong>$141.22</strong> implies that the market is pricing in a highly conservative long-run WTI price of <strong>$68.50/bbl</strong>, providing a compelling margin of safety.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"hero-actions\" style=\"margin-top:24px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n              <a href=\"EOG_DCF_Writeup.pdf\" class=\"btn btn-ink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Diligence Memo (PDF)</a>\n              <a href=\"EOG_DCF_Writeup.md\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Markdown View</a>\n              <a href=\"EOG_DCF_Model.xlsx\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" download>Download Excel Model</a>\n              <a href=\"https://github.com/prathamislit/investwithsnp\" class=\"btn btn-outline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">View Repository</a>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div>\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em\">Price sensitivity <em style=\"color:var(--gh)\">surface</em></h2>\n            <div class=\"chart-box\" id=\"eog-heatmap-container\" style=\"min-height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px\">\n              <!-- Dynamic SVG sensitivity heatmap injected at runtime -->\n            </div>\n            <p style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--ash);text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:12px;text-align:center\">\n              Intrinsic $/sh &nbsp;·&nbsp; WACC × Long-Run WTI\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <button id=\"dd-back-btn\" class=\"btn btn-ink\" style=\"margin-top:20px\">Return to Quality Ledger</button>\n    </section>\n  </div>",
